without asking. Attribution is welcome but not required.


THE CONTENT — please ask
------------------------
The blog posts, the text of the pages, the photographs, and the academic
documents under document/ are © Stefano Costa. They are published here to be
read, not to be republished. If you would like to reuse a piece of writing or
an image, get in touch — the answer is usually yes.


